<title>JAPAN: TDK Corp shares down on morning profit-taking.</title>
<headline>TDK Corp shares down on morning profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of TDK Corp fell on Friday morning due to profit-taking, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0136 GMT, the shares of the manufacturer of magnetic tapes were down 300 yen at 8,000 yen.  </p>
<p>&quot;The high-tech sector as a whole is stalled,&quot; a trader at a second-tier brokerage said. &quot;TDK shares resisted fiercely when buying in the sector started slowing down, but it is finally succumbing to profit taking.&quot;</p>
</text>
